<p>Haye ali akbar.. Haye ali akbar.. (2)</p> 
<p>Maqtal ki zamee'n aur qayamat ka wo manzar<br> the god mein shabbir ki zakhmi ali akbar<br> bete ki taraf dekhke jab Ya Ali kehkar<br> ek haath rakha seene pe, ek haath sina par<br> seene se sina khaich ke kehne lage sarwar<br> kya baap se is tarha juda hote hai akbar</p> 
<p>meri jaan akbar, tu yaad bohot aaega<br> haye, mere laal akbar, ek baar pukaro baba</p> 
<p>1. Kya tumse kahu kis tarha pohcha hu sirhane<br> mai ghutniyo chal kar tumhe aaya hu uthane<br> aankhein na karo band, meri jaan chalo ghar</p> 
<p>kya baap se is tarha juda hote hai akbar</p> 
