<p>2. Takleef hai seene mein ye ehsaas hai humko<br> mehsoos karo tum bhi to is baap ke ghum ko<br> mar jaunga yu ediya'n ragdo na zamee'n par<br> kya baap se is tarha juda hote hai akbar</p> 
