<p>5. Kyu baap ki aghosh mein dum tod rahe ho<br> ghurbat mein akela hume tum chhod rahe ho<br> kyu hichkiya'n lete ho mere saamne dilbar<br> kya baap se is tarha juda hote hai akbar</p> 
