<p>7. Kuch der mein le aayega qasid khat e sughra<br> hum se na padha jaega tum bhi na tadapna<br> jis waqt pukarunga mai, khat seene pe rakh kar<br> kya baap se is tarha juda hote hai akbar</p> 
